<title>USA: LPC - NationsBank lending Danka Business $1.2 bln.</title>
<headline>LPC - NationsBank lending Danka Business $1.2 bln.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Oct 15 (LPC) - NationsBank Corp will arrange a $1.2 billion acquistion loan backing Britain's Danka Business Systems' acquisition of Eastman Kodak's office imaging and facilities management businesses for $684 million in cash, sources said.</p>
<p>The loan, which also will refinance Danka's existing debt, will have a six-year tenor, sources added.</p>
<p>-- Beth Harmen, LPC Editorial, 212 489 5455</p>
